    "title": "Improved measurements of D meson semileptonic decays to pi and K mesons",
    "arxiv": "[hep-ex/0906.2983v1](https://arxiv.org/pdf/0906.2983v1)",
    "time": "2009.06.16",
    "abstract": "Using the entire CLEO-c psi(3770) -> D Dbar event sample, corresponding to an integrated luminosity of 818 pb-1 and approximately 5.4 million D Dbar events, we present a study of the decays D0 -> pi- e+ nu_e, D0 -> K- e+ nu_e, D+ -> pi0 e+ nu_e, and D+ -> K0bar e+ nu_e. Via a tagged analysis technique, partial rates for semileptonic decays by the other D are measured in several q2 bins. We fit these rates using several form factor parameterizations and report the results.",
